==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

